1
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:28,778
What are you doing, Dong-uk?

2
00:00:28,778 --> 00:00:31,656
Just getting some fresh air.

3
00:00:31,656 --> 00:00:32,615
What's wrong?

4
00:00:32,615 --> 00:00:34,826
Is something bothering you?

5
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,037
I'm fine.

6
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:38,138
Why?

7
00:00:38,139 --> 00:00:39,497
No reason. I just wanted to

8
00:00:39,497 --> 00:00:42,250
hear your voice.

9
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:44,586
But you sound down.

10
00:00:44,586 --> 00:00:47,005
Are you sure nothing's wrong?

11
00:00:47,005 --> 00:00:48,965
I said I'm fine.

12
00:00:48,965 --> 00:00:50,050
That's a relief then.

13
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:51,885
Actually

14
00:00:51,885 --> 00:00:53,928
your dad had surgery

15
00:00:53,928 --> 00:00:56,639
and that cost us a bit.

16
00:00:56,639 --> 00:00:57,801
He'll need to take some

17
00:00:57,802 --> 00:00:59,058
time off work too.

18
00:00:59,059 --> 00:01:00,810
Is he okay?

19
00:01:00,810 --> 00:01:02,937
It's nothing serious.

20
00:01:02,937 --> 00:01:04,207
We're just getting older

21
00:01:04,208 --> 00:01:05,481
that's all.

22
00:01:05,482 --> 00:01:07,067
And that makes me proud of you

23
00:01:07,067 --> 00:01:08,445
and feel so sorry for you

24
00:01:08,446 --> 00:01:09,902
handling everything

25
00:01:09,903 --> 00:01:11,780
on your own like this.

26
00:01:12,655 --> 00:01:13,938
Even getting a scholarship

27
00:01:13,939 --> 00:01:15,491
to cover your tuition...

28
00:01:15,492 --> 00:01:18,578
You've always been our pride.
